WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:12,800
Sorry, I was in an emergency just now and forgot about such a beautiful girl.

2
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:16,820
No wonder they attracted such a big circle. Wild boars have a very good sense of smell.

3
00:00:16,820 --> 00:00:20,820
This soup stock energy bar is several times more attractive to them than ordinary food.

4
00:00:20,820 --> 00:00:24,950
And this is real honey, of excellent quality. No wonder they are crazy.

5
00:00:24,950 --> 00:00:30,430
When I was tired from walking, I took a few bites and stuffed them into my pocket.

6
00:00:30,430 --> 00:00:34,780
This is added with locust pulp. I made it myself.

7
00:00:34,780 --> 00:00:42,780
Apply cold compress first and stop walking.
